


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_fe776d95:


    "——放学后。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_f1ec1a77:



    voice "2HI_1026"
    hina "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_50c77964:


    "阳菜从职员室回来时，与正要离开教室的女生在走廊上擦肩而过。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_4adec55a:


    "阳菜回过头去，目光与心绪被少女的背影带走。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_e5fb943d:


    "那是以前找伦请教过功课的女生。好像是叫本条。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_7df1b526:



    voice "2HI_1027"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_7cea0d4e:


    "阳菜走进教室的时候，伦正站在窗边。教室里只有她们俩。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_1137e3ea:



    voice "2RI_1009"
    rin "「哦，欢迎回来。浅生和圣夜夜去洗手间了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_f8e5d17a:



    voice "2HI_1028"
    hina "「刚才那位是本条同学吧。你们聊什么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_5b4cd905:



    voice "2RI_1010"
    rin "「没……嗯。没聊什么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_f89047d3:



    voice "2HI_1029"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_e31398d1:


    "伦想要岔开话题，但阳菜依然等着回答。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_e06acd0c:



    voice "2RI_1011"
    rin "「那个……说是要送我情人节巧克力」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_a164462c:



    voice "2HI_1030"
    hina "「你怎么回复的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_5c69a321:



    voice "2RI_1012"
    rin "「呃……我说了“谢谢”」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_17b53544:



    voice "2HI_1031"
    hina "「你打算收下？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_cd0506e4:



    voice "2RI_1013"
    rin "「不不我是觉得必须要拒绝的。但一时之间想不到什么好借口」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_87ee29e6:


    "阳菜不偏不倚的视线让伦着了急。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_15de7b8c:



    voice "2RI_1014"
    rin "「我、我有和她说我不喜欢甜食的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_a590f7a3:



    voice "2HI_1032"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_369b0fe0:


    "阳菜思考片刻，缓缓张口。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_ca73270f:



    voice "2HI_1033"
    hina "「我说啊——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_8076ac36:



    voice "2MI_0878"
    miyako "「我们来迟啦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_306b2868:



    voice "2FU_0822"
    fumi "「啊，夏目同学先回来啦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_47c976a2:


    "是文和圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_92655ed8:



    voice "2HI_1034"
    hina "「欢迎回来——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_6bd755a5:


    "阳菜低头数秒后便转身应答。此时的她已经换回了往日的声音与表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_83de0450:



    voice "2HI_1035"
    hina "「我这就去收拾东西准备回去～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_c37d4734:


    "阳菜走向自己的座位，利索地收拾起东西。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_ded7e465:



    voice "2RI_1015"
    rin "「那个，阳菜——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_8bca73ea:



    voice "2HI_1036"
    hina "「啊，我要检查窗户有没有锁，你先出去吧～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_c2e4cb57:



    voice "2RI_1016"
    rin "「啊……嗯」"




translate simplified_chinese a09_cou2_06_2bb28015:


    "——放学后。"
